                  n
                  
                    
                    P
                    1
                  
                
              
            
          
        
       is not preserved under generization (
        
          d
          &gt;
          4
          ,
          g
          ≫
          
            d
          
          1
        
      ) ‣ Tschirnhausen bundles of covers of the projective line" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>), but it is a generization of <math id="S7.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathscr{E}}_{\pi}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript">ℰ</mi><mi>π</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathscr{E}}_{\pi}</annotation></semantics></math>. The statement now follows from Proposition <a href="#S7" title="7. The image of 
        
          
            :
            Tsch
            
              →
              
                ⁢
                H
                u
                
                  
                  r
                  
                    
                      
                      
                      
                    
                    
